  "ia-undated-round-132": "Printings whose scans show no English publication year, so they wait under the undated-printing rule: Plekhanov's Fundamental Problems of Marxism (International Publishers; fundamentalprobl0000plek_n4z2), Gertrude Aretz's Napoleon and His Women Friends (Allen & Unwin; dli.ministry.17674), Faria de Vasconcellos's A New School in Belgium (Harrap; in.ernet.dli.2015.37448) and Wilbuschewitsch's The Industrial Development of Palestine (Zionist Organisation pamphlet; industrialdevelo00vilbrich).",
  "ia-janet-psychological-healing": "Pierre Janet's Psychological Healing (Allen & Unwin, 1925, 2 vols): vol. I is open (in.ernet.dli.2015.52799) but the only vol. II found (psychologicalhea0002pier) carries a 1975 year and looks like a reprint. Waits for a period vol. II.",
  "ia-1930-round-132": "1930 publications waiting on Adam's 1930 ruling: Zweig's Three Masters (threemastersbal00zweigoog), Ludwig's Lincoln (lincolnludw00ludw and others) and Chronos, or the Future of the Family (in.ernet.dli.2015.170120).",
  "ia-treitschke-history-of-germany": "Treitschke's History of Germany in the Nineteenth Century (Jarrold/McBride, 1915-19, 7 vols): scans exist (historyofgermany01treiuoft and others) but the set needs sorting by volume before it is shelved."
 },
